    "faq": {
      "type": "nf-pro-faq",
      "settings": {
        "bg": "white",
        "heading": "Custom lighting questions",
        "show_email": true,
        "open_first": false,
        "eyebrow": "Good to know",
        "text": "The things people ask before they send a request."
      },
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Is there a minimum order?",
            "a": "<p>No. You can ask for a single custom piece or the lighting for a whole building. Larger lists simply get a quote that reflects the volume.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How much does custom lighting cost?",
            "a": "<p>It depends on what changes. A new finish or color is usually the simplest change. A new size, a different light source or new mounting takes more work. You get an exact price in writing before anything is made, and the quote is free.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Can I customize something from a concept?",
            "a": "<p>Yes. Open any concept and choose Customize this look. You can ask for the whole look or just one piece, in your own size and finish.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "What if I do not know the exact specs?",
            "a": "<p>That is fine. Tell us the room, rough sizes, the ceiling or wall you are working with and the look you like. A photo or a link helps. We will suggest what fits and ask for anything we need.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How long does it take?",
            "a": "<p>We reply to every request within 2 business days. Once you approve the quote, production and delivery usually take 4 to 7 weeks. Your quote shows the timing for your exact order.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "How do I pay?",
            "a": "<p>Asking for a quote costs nothing. When you are happy with it, we send a secure Shopify invoice and you pay online. Your order goes into production after payment.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q7": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Can I return a custom or made to order piece?",
            "a": "<p>Custom and made to order pieces are built for your order, so they cannot be returned for a change of mind. If anything arrives damaged or faulty, we replace it or refund it. Email photos to info@norafurnish.com as soon as you can and we will put it right.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q8": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "q": "Are the portfolio projects real client jobs?",
            "a": "<p>No. They are design concepts created by our team to show what our lighting can do in different spaces. Every fixture shown is a real product you can buy, order in quantity or customize.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
